f460c8d2b1ca","downloadCount":2,"id":"RA_kwDOVPcXOs4nGf3v","label":"","name":"upkg-index.txt","size":628,"state":"uploaded","updatedAt":"2026-10-19T10:56:34Z","url":"https://github.com/spotUP/vtcon/releases/download/v1.0/upkg-index.txt"}],"body":"UP-Term 1.0 for AmigaOS (68020+), with the upkg package feed.\n\nBuilt from spotUP/UP-Term (vtcon) 01c90f5b and upterm-ports 7a0aba5.\n\n- UP-Term.lha: base install. UP-Term-src.lha: matching sources.\n- Add-ons: Claude 1.1, amiga-pi 1.0, UP-Term-nvim 1.0, Python3 1.0 (as .lha and as .ipk for upkg).\n- Packages / Packages.gz / upkg-index.txt: upkg feed index; upkg reads them from releases/latest/download.\n\nChanges in this build: ncurses redraws in one write per frame and caches tparm results (faster scrolling in full-screen programs); ixemul compat log2 is exact for powers of two.\n","createdAt":"2026-10-19T10:56:28Z","name":"UP-Term 1.0","tagName":"v1.0","targetCommitish":"main"}
